The site user is no longer created on application startup. It is now created by
``ckan db init`` and ``ckan db upgrade``, so run ``ckan db upgrade`` after
upgrading to make sure it exists. Code that requests the site user before it has
been created will raise an error instead of creating it on the fly.

Extensions should replace ``get_action("get_site_user")(...)["name"]`` with
``toolkit.get_site_user().name``. The new function returns a ``model.User``
object instead of a dict.
